      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "- Availability > Consistency (eventual consistency) for appearance of new messages in\nour chatrooms & message inboxes\n- Low Latency <100ms & high scalability for reading and writing\n- Guaranteed Message delivery (such as if the receiving user is offline)\n- Fault Tolerant servers",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Availability > Consistency (eventual consistency) for appearance of new messages in\nour chatrooms & message inboxes\n- Low Latency <100ms & high scalability for reading and writing\n- Guaranteed Message delivery (such as if the receiving user is offline)\n- Fault Tolerant servers",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "baseline": 115,
      "index": "aC",
      "autoResize": true
    },
